        "PMC12839976::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing passive-film breakdown relative to film reformation accelerates total degradation.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-produced high-entropy alloy has a stable passivating oxide layer.",
