      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermal treatment or microalloying can improve surface-film stability or tribo-corrosion performance in some high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12565319::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Passive-film integrity and its disruption and repassivation kinetics mediate the interaction between wear and corrosion.",
